<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1960852861"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1822731595"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="stars we chase"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="内田秀"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Eutopia / EMOTION / stars we chase【鐘 嵐珠盤】"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:07.804"><div begin="00:00.877" end="03:07.944"><p begin="00:00.877" end="00:04.873" itunes:key="L40235">I used to look above at stars, and chase<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾经仰望漫天繁星 鼓起勇气追逐那璀璨的星星</span></p><p begin="00:05.121" end="00:08.728" itunes:key="L40236">Never had to doubt what I could take<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不曾怀疑我眼前这唾手可得的一切</span></p><p begin="00:09.304" end="00:13.030" itunes:key="L40237">Now I've found it's further than it seemed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我却发现一切似乎比看起来更遥远</span></p><p begin="00:13.040" end="00:17.837" itunes:key="L40238">The light gets smaller, my eyes to a closure<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星光渐渐变得黯淡 我索性闭上双眼</span></p><p begin="00:18.202" end="00:21.994" itunes:key="L40239">When did it happen? Turned away my face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是什么时候发生的事情</span></p><p begin="00:22.338" end="00:24.821" itunes:key="L40240">When did it happen? Pain increasing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是什么时候发生的事情</span></p><p begin="00:26.608" end="00:30.761" itunes:key="L40241">Shadow walk and dealing, truth inside revealing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">漫步于暗影之中 游刃有余地应对现状 真相慢慢浮现眼前</span></p><p begin="00:30.771" end="00:33.369" itunes:key="L40242">Still, a part of me's seeking that feeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我内心深处依然寻觅着那份情愫</span></p><p begin="00:33.379" end="00:37.644" itunes:key="L40243">Dreams in the sound I made for you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾为你创作承载着梦想的音乐</span></p><p begin="00:37.959" end="00:42.533" itunes:key="L40244">Go 'round, come returning through me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">兜兜转转 再次回到我身边</span></p><p begin="00:42.543" end="00:49.506" itunes:key="L40245">Where this light shines so bright, you showed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你指引我走向那闪烁着璀璨光芒的地方</span></p><p begin="00:49.881" end="00:51.198" itunes:key="L40246">It's back and now<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一切都卷土重来 此时此刻</span></p><p begin="00:51.208" end="00:53.145" itunes:key="L40247">Take your hand out, we can reach<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请伸出你的手 我们可以够到</span></p><p begin="00:53.155" end="00:55.080" itunes:key="L40248">Always been there to be freed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">与我们如影随行 等待释放的梦想</span></p><p begin="00:55.090" end="00:57.249" itunes:key="L40249">It's getting loud, on to a scream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心的心声愈发响亮 渴望大声呐喊</span></p><p begin="00:57.259" end="01:00.120" itunes:key="L40250">We're starting this brighter tomorrow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们开启光明美好的未来</span></p><p begin="01:02.692" end="01:03.678" itunes:key="L40251">Try this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尝试一番</span></p><p begin="01:05.236" end="01:10.401" itunes:key="L40252">Every color shown, bright in the star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">色彩斑斓的星辰绽放耀眼的光芒</span></p><p begin="01:14.941" end="01:19.194" itunes:key="L40253">From here we can find<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从这里开始 我们可以找到梦想</span></p><p begin="01:19.320" end="01:23.361" itunes:key="L40254">Letting us shine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们绽放光芒吧</span></p><p begin="01:23.371" end="01:25.612" itunes:key="L40255">Don't hide your brightness<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">千万不要隐藏你的光辉</span></p><p begin="01:26.348" end="01:30.208" itunes:key="L40256">Approval of someone to feel complete<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对某人完全的认可</span></p><p begin="01:30.749" end="01:34.519" itunes:key="L40257">Honesty was gone to say the least<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">至少可以说 坦诚不复存在</span></p><p begin="01:35.005" end="01:38.567" itunes:key="L40258">Many things about us are the same<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们之间 有很多相似之处</span></p><p begin="01:38.577" end="01:43.398" itunes:key="L40259">The distance for us is hard to decipher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">距离对我们来说是个难以理解的难题</span></p><p begin="01:43.782" end="01:47.886" itunes:key="L40260">Why did it happen? I've imagined your face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么会这样? 我想象过你的脸庞</span></p><p begin="01:47.896" end="01:50.425" itunes:key="L40261">Thinking about this lonely feeling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回想这孤独之感</span></p><p begin="01:52.217" end="01:56.239" itunes:key="L40262">Standing still exceeding, urge and drive increasing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呆站在原地 只觉力不从心</span></p><p begin="01:56.249" end="01:58.940" itunes:key="L40263">I've gotta be by you and speaking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要在你身边 诉说一切</span></p><p begin="01:58.950" end="02:03.274" itunes:key="L40264">A little time has been taken<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">花一点时间</span></p><p begin="02:03.626" end="02:08.130" itunes:key="L40265">I find it was time we needed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想是时候了</span></p><p begin="02:08.140" end="02:14.998" itunes:key="L40266">When our minds are aligned, we know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在我们心意相通时 就已明白</span></p><p begin="02:15.350" end="02:16.815" itunes:key="L40267">That star's in view<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那颗星星近在眼前</span></p><p begin="02:16.838" end="02:18.796" itunes:key="L40268">Let's restart it, you and me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们重新开始吧</span></p><p begin="02:18.819" end="02:20.624" itunes:key="L40269">Walking on our new story<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始属于我们的故事</span></p><p begin="02:20.634" end="02:22.791" itunes:key="L40270">I feel your voice, my melodies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我感觉我的旋律回荡着你的声音</span></p><p begin="02:22.801" end="02:25.738" itunes:key="L40271">Don't worry when struggling to follow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不必担心 我们终会跟上节奏</span></p><p begin="02:28.220" end="02:29.333" itunes:key="L40272">Find this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">寻觅</span></p><p begin="02:32.153" end="02:33.409" itunes:key="L40273">Allow this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">允许</span></p><p begin="02:33.419" end="02:35.520" itunes:key="L40274">Take your hand out, we can reach<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伸出你的手 这样我们可以触摸</span></p><p begin="02:35.530" end="02:37.393" itunes:key="L40275">Always been there to be freed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一刻渴望着恣意自由</span></p><p begin="02:37.403" end="02:39.452" itunes:key="L40276">It's getting loud, on to a scream<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">声音越来越大 变成嘶声呐喊</span></p><p begin="02:39.462" end="02:42.756" itunes:key="L40277">We're starting this brighter tomorrow<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们要开启明媚的未来</span></p><p begin="02:44.892" end="02:45.965" itunes:key="L40278">Try this<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">试试吧</span></p><p begin="02:47.541" end="02:52.996" itunes:key="L40279">Every color shown, bright in the star<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">色彩斑斓的星辰绽放耀眼的光芒</span></p><p begin="02:57.130" end="03:01.630" itunes:key="L40280">From here we can find<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">此时此刻 我们终会发现</span></p><p begin="03:01.640" end="03:05.613" itunes:key="L40281">Letting us shine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们绽放光芒吧</span></p><p begin="03:05.623" end="03:07.944" itunes:key="L40282">Don't hide your brightness<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要遮掩你的光芒</span></p></div></body></tt>